<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<EnablementProgramDefinition xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <description>Learn how Rochester Electronics&apos; TLS360™ program provides long-term lifecycle assurance for mission-critical semiconductor product families. Develop the skills to explain TLS360, communicate customer value, and position Rochester&apos;s lifecycle support beyond traditional manufacturer roadmaps. Complete a recorded customer pitch assessment.</description>
